    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play as a dog your way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become mankind\u2019s best friend or worst nightmare! Befriend the people around you to get good stuff or just steal anything not locked down. Pick a path with dog skills to hone your dog and perfect the way you want to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/53ba03bc3be147b6f35684397c207571.poster.avif?t=1754769929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/53ba03bc3be147b6f35684397c207571.webm?t=1754769929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/53ba03bc3be147b6f35684397c207571.mp4?t=1754769929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survive in a vast modern world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scavenge, loot, and dig your way through life. Explore a world where the people and items are always changing. The city and its surroundings are yours to make your own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/e784602254a6a2d0dd3e4b2ddb3fac4b.poster.avif?t=1754769929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/e784602254a6a2d0dd3e4b2ddb3fac4b.webm?t=1754769929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/e784602254a6a2d0dd3e4b2ddb3fac4b.mp4?t=1754769929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Trade for the Best Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Need a quick snack? How about a weapon or some armor? This cat has it all but drives a hard bargain. Never fear! There is always room to negotiate. Sell special items, haggle, and do favors to get those prices right where you need them to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/99e284f8d82538067df2454bbddcf716.poster.avif?t=1754769929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/99e284f8d82538067df2454bbddcf716.webm?t=1754769929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/99e284f8d82538067df2454bbddcf716.mp4?t=1754769929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Deck out your penthouse</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No dog should be without a home. And for you that means getting a badass apartment with the best stuff the city has to offer. Acquire amazing food, water, crafting options, and plenty more by expanding your apartment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/a0c4280423a7f2aff0e7e39079769b11.poster.avif?t=1754769929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/a0c4280423a7f2aff0e7e39079769b11.webm?t=1754769929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/a0c4280423a7f2aff0e7e39079769b11.mp4?t=1754769929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Uncover the Mystery of Doggo City</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Why are all the other pets missing, what happened to your human, and why do bad things keep happening to you? Work with a colorful cast of allies to uncover the mysteries of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/07979fc2c52881d2c2687de29141ebb3.poster.avif?t=1754769929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/07979fc2c52881d2c2687de29141ebb3.webm?t=1754769929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/07979fc2c52881d2c2687de29141ebb3.mp4?t=1754769929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play as a dog your way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become mankind\u2019s best friend or worst nightmare! Befriend the people around you to get good stuff or just steal anything not locked down. Pick a path with dog skills to hone your dog and perfect the way you want to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/53ba03bc3be147b6f35684397c207571.poster.avif?t=1754769929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/53ba03bc3be147b6f35684397c207571.webm?t=1754769929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/53ba03bc3be147b6f35684397c207571.mp4?t=1754769929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survive in a vast modern world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scavenge, loot, and dig your way through life. Explore a world where the people and items are always changing. The city and its surroundings are yours to make your own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/e784602254a6a2d0dd3e4b2ddb3fac4b.poster.avif?t=1754769929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/e784602254a6a2d0dd3e4b2ddb3fac4b.webm?t=1754769929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/e784602254a6a2d0dd3e4b2ddb3fac4b.mp4?t=1754769929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Trade for the Best Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Need a quick snack? How about a weapon or some armor? This cat has it all but drives a hard bargain. Never fear! There is always room to negotiate. Sell special items, haggle, and do favors to get those prices right where you need them to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/99e284f8d82538067df2454bbddcf716.poster.avif?t=1754769929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/99e284f8d82538067df2454bbddcf716.webm?t=1754769929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/99e284f8d82538067df2454bbddcf716.mp4?t=1754769929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Deck out your penthouse</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No dog should be without a home. And for you that means getting a badass apartment with the best stuff the city has to offer. Acquire amazing food, water, crafting options, and plenty more by expanding your apartment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/a0c4280423a7f2aff0e7e39079769b11.poster.avif?t=1754769929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/a0c4280423a7f2aff0e7e39079769b11.webm?t=1754769929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/a0c4280423a7f2aff0e7e39079769b11.mp4?t=1754769929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Uncover the Mystery of Doggo City</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Why are all the other pets missing, what happened to your human, and why do bad things keep happening to you? Work with a colorful cast of allies to uncover the mysteries of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/07979fc2c52881d2c2687de29141ebb3.poster.avif?t=1754769929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/07979fc2c52881d2c2687de29141ebb3.webm?t=1754769929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/07979fc2c52881d2c2687de29141ebb3.mp4?t=1754769929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "short_description": "Survive as a stray dog in a large open world. Scavenge, craft, trade, and steal your way into a world where all the pets are disappearing. Arm yourself and take to the streets to rise from homeless to well-off no matter what it takes. What kind of story will you tell?",
